 location="Nucleus under the facial colliculus in the caudal pons → fascicle through the pontine tegmentum and basis pontis → exit in the pontomedullary sulcus → ascends on the clivus in the prepontine cistern → Dorello's canal at the petrous apex → within the cavernous sinus lateral to the internal carotid → superior orbital fissure inside the annulus of Zinn → lateral rectus.",
